<main class="w-full pt-20 bg-background">{% include '@waukee_theme/includes/tw-alert.html.twig' %}<div class="flex flex-col w-full"><section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-sm border-b border-surface-container"><div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin flex items-center justify-between text-body-sm"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm"><a class="hover:text-primary flex items-center gap-1 transition-colors" href="/"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">home</span><span>Home</span></a><span class="text-outline-variant">/</span><span class="text-primary font-bold">Academics</span></nav></div></section><section class="relative w-full bg-primary-container text-on-primary py-space-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm"><div class="absolute -right-16 -top-20 w-96 h-96 bg-accent-gold-bright/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-space-md"><div class="max-w-3xl flex flex-col gap-space-sm"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-start px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-fixed/20 text-secondary-fixed text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-bold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]">school</span><span>District Learning</span></div><h1 class="font-display-hero text-headline-xl md:text-display-hero text-text-on-dark tracking-tight leading-tight">Academics</h1><div class="mt-2 p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-base/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-surface-base/15"><h2 class="font-title-md text-title-md font-bold text-accent-gold-bright mb-1">What We Do</h2><p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-surface-container-high/90 leading-relaxed">Our educators are focused on the joy of learning and fostering an environment where every student can thrive based on their individual needs. In our academics, we prioritize innovation, inclusivity, and collaboration to prepare our students to embrace tomorrow’s opportunities.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin py-space-xl"><div class="mb-space-lg max-w-2xl"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-bold">Instructional Framework</span><h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight font-bold">Core Academic Pillars</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-lg"><div class="bg-surface-base rounded-2xl p-space-lg shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-accent-gold-bright flex items-center justify-center mb-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">menu_book</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Curriculum</h3><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Waukee CSD is dedicated to providing a challenging and engaging learning experience. Teams of educators collaborate on a predetermined cycle to review and enhance the curriculum across all educational areas. Our curriculum clearly defines objectives to ensure every student knows, understands, and can apply their knowledge effectively.</p></div><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-text-on-dark font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span><span>Learn About Our Curriculum</span></a></div></div><div class="bg-surface-base rounded-2xl p-space-lg shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-accent-gold-bright flex items-center justify-center mb-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">assignment_turned_in</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Academic Assessments</h3><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">At Waukee CSD, teachers use assessments to measure a student’s knowledge, skills, abilities, or performance in a specific study area. Standards-based reporting ensures that instruction, assessment, grading, and academic reporting are all determined when a student can showcase mastery of the knowledge and skills expected at each level.</p></div><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-text-on-dark font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span><span>Understand Our Assessments</span></a></div></div><div class="bg-surface-base rounded-2xl p-space-lg shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-accent-gold-bright flex items-center justify-center mb-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">library_books</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Course Descriptions</h3><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">At Waukee CSD, students gain more flexibility in their academic class choices as they advance. Our course description guide displays our variety of classes, designed to help students find and pursue their passions. Guided by our curriculum, we offer traditional academic subjects and career-oriented learning, supported by our Career Compass program. This holistic approach ensures students achieve success and acquire practical skills for their future endeavors.</p></div><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-primary hover:bg-primary-container text-text-on-dark font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm" href="#"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span><span>Review Our Secondary Course Descriptions</span></a></div></div><div class="bg-surface-base rounded-2xl p-space-lg shadow-sm border border-surface-container flex flex-col justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-container text-accent-gold-bright flex items-center justify-center mb-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">support</span></div><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">Student Support Services</h3><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Student Services helps foster academic growth according to each student’s needs. At Waukee CSD, we offer a range of services, including developing 504 plans, addressing the needs of at-risk students, supporting students with special needs, and providing English for Speakers of Other Languages (ESOL) programs. Additionally, we are committed to recognizing and supporting gifted learners in our Extended Learning Program (ELP).</p></div><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-space-md py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold transition-colors" href="/students/resources"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">group</span><span>Student Services Department</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl border-t border-b border-surface-container"><div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin"><div class="mb-space-lg max-w-2xl"><span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary font-bold">Governance &amp; Guidelines</span><h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight font-bold">Board Policies Concerning Instructional Materials</h2><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Review official Waukee Board of Education policies on the selection, reconsideration, inspection, and display of instructional resources.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md"><a class="bg-surface-base p-space-md rounded-xl border border-surface-container shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex items-center justify-between group" href="/community/board-of-education"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-purple-tint text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-text-on-dark transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">description</span></div><span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary font-bold group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Objection to Instructional Materials and Reconsideration Procedures</span></div><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">open_in_new</span></a><a class="bg-surface-base p-space-md rounded-xl border border-surface-container shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all flex items-center justify-between group" href="/community/board-of-education"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-accent-purple-tint text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-text-on-dark transition-colors"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">policy</span></div><span class="font-title-md text-title-md text-primary font-bold group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors">Instructional Materials Selection Policy 0602.8</span></div><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">open_in_new</span></a><a class="bg-surface-base p-space-md rounded-xl border border-surface-contai